"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"Guanghua Hospital - Joint Disease Specialist\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-white\"><section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-slate-950\"><img src=\"https://conversation.cdn.meoo.host/conversations/305931829356183552/image/2026-06-08/1780904580769-上海中医药大学附属光华医院.jpeg?auth_key=cf9eab76aa1bd2a530616b3d51902b6ba3575d6bc58b7dce4d0d032725154028\" alt=\"上海光华医院外观\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-950/85 via-green-950/70 to-teal-950/80\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center text-white py-32\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6\">上海中医药大学附属光华医院</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-300 mb-4\">上海市光华中西医结合医院</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\">以关节病、风湿性疾病中西医结合诊治为特色的三级甲等专科医院</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-8\"><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">始建于1958年</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">国家区域关节病诊疗中心</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">全市唯一24小时痛风急诊</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><button class=\"px-8 py-3 bg-white text-teal-900 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors\">了解更多</button><a class=\"px-8 py-3 border-2 border-white text-white rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">预约咨询</a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"intro\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">医院简介</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6 mb-12\"><div class=\"bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-2\">1958年</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">建院时间</p></div><div class=\"bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-2\">600张</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">规划床位</p></div><div class=\"bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-2\">三级甲等</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">医院等级</p></div><div class=\"bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-2\">2个院区</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">新华路、延安西路</p></div><div class=\"bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-2\">&gt;80%</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">关节病专科床位占比</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-50 to-green-50 rounded-2xl p-8 space-y-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">上海中医药大学附属光华医院（上海市光华中西医结合医院）始建于1958年，是一所以关节病、风湿性疾病中西医结合诊治为特色的三级甲等专科医院。医院现有新华路、延安西路两个院区，2026年5月新院区正式启用，规划床位600张。</p><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">医院是国家区域关节病诊疗中心，关节病专科床位占比超80%，风湿免疫科、骨伤科为国家中医优势专科。医院持有蛇制剂、问荆合剂、舒筋合剂等院内特色制剂，髋膝关节置换手术量位于上海前列，肘、踝关节置换量位于全国前列。医院正由专科医院向综合医院转型，并开设全市唯一24小时痛风急诊。</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">优势治疗项目</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">以中西医结合为特色，在关节病和风湿病的诊治领域形成了显著的学科优势</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-teal-50\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"w-fit px-3 py-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full\">国家中医优势专科</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-teal-700\">风湿免疫科</h3><p class=\"border-l-4 border-[#7CB342] pl-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">国家中医药管理局区域中医（风湿病）诊疗中心建设单位</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>擅长类风湿关节炎、强直性脊柱炎、骨关节炎、痛风性关节炎、系统性红斑狼疮等诊治</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>开展抗CCP抗体、HLA-B27、GPI抗原等多项前沿检测项目</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>早期诊断准确率居于国内领先水平</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>拥有蛇制剂等院内特色中成药制剂</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-teal-50\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"w-fit px-3 py-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full\">国家中医优势专科</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-teal-700\">骨伤科</h3><p class=\"border-l-4 border-[#7CB342] pl-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">下设关节外科、脊柱外科、手足创伤外科等亚专业方向</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>系统开展髋、膝、肩、肘、踝人工关节置换及翻修手术</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>关节置换量在上海乃至全国具有较高知名度</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>髋膝关节置换手术量位于上海前列</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>肘、踝关节置换量位于全国前列</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>能够开展颈椎类风湿性关节炎前后路手术、强直性脊柱炎后凸矫形等复杂手术</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-teal-50\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"w-fit px-3 py-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full\">国家中医药管理局重点建设专科</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-teal-700\">关节内科</h3><p class=\"border-l-4 border-[#7CB342] pl-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">上海市中医特色专科、上海市中医重点学科</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>专注于类风湿关节炎、强直性脊柱炎等风湿病的药物及中西医结合治疗</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>在关节病早期诊断和中西医协同治疗方面拥有丰富经验</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-teal-50\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"w-fit px-3 py-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full\">上海市中医优势专科</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-teal-700\">康复科</h3><p class=\"border-l-4 border-[#7CB342] pl-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">国家中西医协同\"旗舰\"科室建设项目</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>以颈肩腰腿痛中医综合一体化诊疗为特色</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>综合运用针刀、银质针、温针灸、推拿、整脊等中医特色疗法</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>结合臭氧、射频、针刀镜等现代治疗技术</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>在脊柱关节病和关节周围软组织疼痛性疾病诊疗方面具有显著疗效</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-teal-50\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"w-fit px-3 py-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full\">全市唯一</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-teal-700\">痛风科</h3><p class=\"border-l-4 border-[#7CB342] pl-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">开设全市唯一的24小时痛风急诊服务</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>专注于痛风性关节炎的急慢性期中西医结合治疗</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>提供全天候紧急医疗服务</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-teal-50\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"w-fit px-3 py-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full\">中西医结合特色</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-teal-700\">肿瘤科</h3><p class=\"border-l-4 border-[#7CB342] pl-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-gray-700\">涵盖肿瘤内科、肿瘤介入、中西医结合治疗三大方向</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>从早癌诊治到化疗、免疫、靶向以及中医、中西医结合肿瘤内科治疗</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>提供综合诊疗服务</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">专家团队 实力护航</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-12\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200\">各科室核心专家</h3><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-6\">风湿免疫科</h4><div class=\"mb-6 bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-teal-700 mb-2\">何东仪</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">学科带头人</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">杨晓凌</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">1993年毕业于上海中医药大学，2005年起担任痛风科主任\n师从上海市风湿病名家倪立青主任\n擅长痛风、强直性脊柱炎、骨质疏松及系统性红斑狼疮等风湿免疫疾病的中西医结合治疗</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-6\">关节外科</h4><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">欧阳桂林</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">关节外科主任、主任医师、博士、硕士生导师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">擅长人工膝、髋、肘、踝、肩关节置换及翻修术\n在类风湿性关节炎、强直性脊柱炎、骨关节炎等关节疾病的手术治疗方面有丰富经验</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">何勇</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">关节矫形外科主任、主任医师、医学博士、硕士生导师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">在肩、膝、髋、肘等关节疾病的诊治方面经验丰富\n擅长关节镜微创手术及人工关节置换术\n获上海市\"银蛇奖\"提名奖和上海市\"青年五四奖章\"</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">高华利</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">副主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">擅长关节镜手术及机器人辅助关节置换</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">韩大鹏</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">副主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">擅长人工关节置换术及关节镜手术</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">徐岳林</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">率先在国内开展膝、髋人工关节置换</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-6\">脊柱外科</h4><div class=\"mb-6 bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-teal-700 mb-2\">黄正</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">脊柱外科主任、主任医师、骨科博士、硕士生导师</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">黄正</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">脊柱外科主任</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">擅长腰椎间盘突出症、腰椎管狭窄症、颈椎病、强直性脊柱炎、类风湿关节炎等疾病的中西医结合和微创治疗</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">张子峰</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">脊柱创伤外科主任、副主任医师、医学博士</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">擅长脊柱疾病的微创治疗及复杂颈椎病的手术治疗</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">肖涟波</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">骨科主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">在脊柱外科领域开展人工关节置换及脊柱相关疾病的中西医结合治疗</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-6\">康复科</h4><div class=\"mb-6 bg-teal-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-teal-700 mb-2\">程少丹</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">康复学科主任、主任医师、研究生导师</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">程少丹</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">康复学科主任</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">上海市中医药（临床类）重点学科中医康复学学科带头人\n国家中西医协同\"旗舰\"科室建设项目负责人\n上海市长宁区名中医\n在上海三甲医院中首创颈肩腰腿痛专业诊疗及康复科室\n形成了颈肩腰腿痛中医综合一体化诊疗服务体系\n开展了华东地区首台针刀镜技术</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-6\">其他科室</h4><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">刘煊</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">肿瘤科主任、教授</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">科室已成长为以中西医结合防治肿瘤为特色的临床科室\n建立了从早癌诊治到化疗、免疫、靶向、中医及中西医结合的综合诊疗能力</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">马丹军</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">内科主任</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">毕业于同济大学医学院医疗系，从事内科领域工作近30年\n在内科常见病、多发病的诊疗方面经验丰富</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">黄天生</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">消化内科主任、主任医师、医学博士、硕士生导师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">师从上海市名中医朱生樑教授\n兼任中华中医药学会脾胃病分会委员、上海市中医药学会脾胃病分会副主任委员等职</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-teal-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">孙克敏</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-teal-600 mb-3\">耳鼻喉科主任、医学博士、硕士生导师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">兼任世界中联耳鼻喉口腔科专业委员会常务理事\n中国中西医结合学会耳鼻咽喉科专业委员会变态反应专家委员会副主任委员</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-600 to-green-700 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">中西医结合 · 专注关节风湿</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-teal-100 mb-8\">地址：上海市新华路、延安西路两个院区</p><a class=\"inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-white text-teal-600 rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">立即预约咨询</a></div></div></section></main>"